  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following the release of UNESCO&apos;s flagship publication &apos;&apos;Reimagining Our Futures Together: A new social contract for education&apos;&apos;, the Junior Professional Officer will support the organization of global and regional launches as well as the implementation an engagement strategy. With multiple components, the strategy is based on open platforms and a decentralized approach that mobilizes students, educators, youth, teacher education professionals, curriculum developers, professional organizations, networks and advocacy groups, researchers, and international education and developments organizations to engage / react / discuss / act on the publication recommendations.</narrative>
